ChronaLink is an intelligent file version tracker that automatically creates meaningful snapshots of local projects, generates AI-powered change summaries, and allows developers to navigate project history using natural language queries.

Features:
- Automatic project snapshots
- AI-generated commit summaries
- Natural language search through project history
- Timeline visualization
- Restore files from any snapshot
- Cross-platform support (Windows, Linux, macOS)
- Lightweight and privacy-focused

Example Queries:
- "Show changes related to authentication"
- "Find when the payment API was added"
- "Restore the version before the database migration"

Tech Stack:
- Python
- SQLite
- FastAPI
- React
- Git Integration
AI-powered project history explorer with automatic snapshots, smart change summaries, and natural language search.
